{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "io.github.hawchou1995.pi-desktop-blender-bridge",
  "name": "PI Blender Bridge",
  "version": "3.1.4",
  "main": "main.js",
  "description": "Drive Blender from PI-Desktop over a loopback Gateway: six agent tools (blender_session / blender_op / blender_py / blender_see / blender_run / blender_inspect), protocol 12 addon handshake, GUI capture, bounded headless jobs, lease/scope/txn. Host adaptation of dsh-blender-plugin 3.1.0-alpha.1 (pinned commit 6c56147); the 34-family/228-op catalog and the Python kernel are the upstream runtime, not a reimplementation.",
  "author": "hawchou1995",
  "license": "BSD-3-Clause",
  "repository": "https://github.com/hawchou1995/pi-desktop-blender-bridge",
  "i18n": {
    "en": {
      "name": "PI Blender Bridge",
      "description": "Six agent tools that drive Blender through a loopback Gateway (session / op / py / see / run / inspect), with headless render jobs and viewport capture.",
      "safetyNotes": "Local code execution inside Blender (blender_py, blender_run headless) authorised by the tool caller · Loopback-only Gateway with a per-run HTTP token · Addon pairing code required for the /addon upgrade · No telemetry, no runtime downloads, no elevation · Needs Node 22 or newer and Blender 4.2 or newer."
    },
    "zh-CN": {
      "name": "PI Blender 桥接",
      "description": "通过本机 loopback Gateway 驱动 Blender 的六个 agent 工具（session / op / py / see / run / inspect），含无头渲染作业与视口抓帧。",
      "safetyNotes": "Blender 内的本地代码执行（blender_py、blender_run headless）由工具调用方授权 · Gateway 只监听 loopback，每次加载生成一次性 HTTP token · /addon 升级需要配对码 · 无遥测、无运行时下载、无提权 · 需要 Node 22 或更高与 Blender 4.2 或更高。"
    }
  },
  "categories": [
    "developer-tools",
    "productivity"
  ],
  "safetyNotes": [
    "blender_py and blender_run(kind=headless) execute code inside Blender: they are a local code-execution surface, authorised by the model calling the tool.",
    "The plugin starts one Gateway child process per load on 127.0.0.1 (default port 39877) and stops it on unload. Every HTTP route requires a per-run token generated at load; anonymous loopback callers are refused.",
    "The Blender addon dials ws://127.0.0.1:<port>/addon with a pairing secret in the x-dsh-bridge-token header (source delta: patches/addon-pairing-token.mjs). A dialer without the exact code is refused before the WebSocket upgrade; the code never travels in the URL, the logs, or a tool result.",
    "No telemetry, no runtime downloads, no elevation. Requires a Node >= 22 interpreter (PI-Desktop's own Node or one on PATH) and an installed Blender 4.2+ (tested on Blender 5.3).",
    "Pairing: generate/copy the code from the command palette or the panel, paste it once into the Blender add-on preference Gateway Pairing Code (or set DSHBB_GATEWAY_TOKEN). Rotating the code requires re-pairing.",
    "The shipped addon zip is built from the pinned GPL-3.0-or-later source plus the documented pairing delta; installing it in Blender is a user action, this plugin never installs it silently."
  ],
  "permissions": [
    "agent.tool.register",
    "agent.prompt.inject",
    "ui.panel"
  ],
  "ui": {
    "panel": "panel/index.html",
    "width": 560,
    "height": 520,
    "title": {
      "en": "Blender Bridge",
      "zh-CN": "Blender 桥接"
    }
  },
  "activationEvents": [
    "onStartup",
    "onCommand:blender-bridge.open-panel"
  ],
  "contributes": {
    "commands": [
      {
        "id": "blender-bridge.open-panel",
        "title": "Blender Bridge: 打开诊断面板",
        "category": "Blender"
      },
      {
        "id": "blender-bridge.status",
        "title": "Blender Bridge: 状态",
        "category": "Blender"
      },
      {
        "id": "blender-bridge.restart-gateway",
        "title": "Blender Bridge: 重启 Gateway",
        "category": "Blender"
      },
      {
        "id": "blender-bridge.addon-path",
        "title": "Blender Bridge: 复制 addon zip 路径",
        "category": "Blender"
      },
      {
        "id": "blender-bridge.pairing-code",
        "title": "Blender Bridge: 复制配对码",
        "category": "Blender"
      },
      {
        "id": "blender-bridge.rotate-pairing",
        "title": "Blender Bridge: 轮换配对码",
        "category": "Blender"
      }
    ],
    "settings": [
      {
        "key": "gatewayPort",
        "title": "Gateway 端口（loopback）",
        "description": "Gateway 只监听 127.0.0.1。默认 39877 与 addon 默认一致；改动后需在 Blender 的 N 面板把 Gateway Port 改成同一个值。",
        "type": "number",
        "default": 39877
      },
      {
        "key": "blenderExe",
        "title": "Blender 可执行文件（可选）",
        "description": "留空则用 Gateway 的自动探测。/blender_run(kind=headless) 与 GUI 会话都用它启动 Blender。",
        "type": "string",
        "default": ""
      },
      {
        "key": "nodePath",
        "title": "Node 可执行文件（可选）",
        "description": "Gateway 需要 Node >= 22（上游 engines 要求 >= 24.9）。留空时依次尝试 PI-Desktop 自带 Node 与 PATH 上的 node。",
        "type": "string",
        "default": ""
      },
      {
        "key": "workDir",
        "title": "运行目录（可选）",
        "description": "作业、日志、帧与 Gateway owner 文件的落盘根目录。留空用插件数据目录下的 rt/。",
        "type": "string",
        "default": ""
      },
      {
        "key": "autoStart",
        "title": "加载时自动启动 Gateway",
        "description": "关闭后需手动执行命令 “Blender Bridge: 重启 Gateway”。",
        "type": "boolean",
        "default": true
      }
    ],
    "agentTools": [
      {
        "name": "blender_session",
        "description": "[v3.1] 会话/归属/权限/事务：list/status/doctor/attach/claim/grant/revoke/grants/pause/resume/mark_read/presence/heartbeat/start/stop/txn。Gateway 由 PI 插件托管。",
        "risk": "medium",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "action": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "list",
                "status",
                "doctor",
                "attach",
                "claim",
                "detach",
                "release",
                "grant",
                "revoke",
                "grants",
                "pause",
                "resume",
                "mark_read",
                "presence",
                "heartbeat",
                "start",
                "stop",
                "txn",
                "help"
              ]
            },
            "session_id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "instance_id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "kind": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "scopes": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "target_agent_id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "target_dsh_session_id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "target_host_id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "grant_id": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "ttl_ms": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "op": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "snapshot",
                "restore",
                "list",
                "prune",
                "mark",
                "revert",
                "marks",
                "drop",
                "help"
              ]
            },
            "label": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "note": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "objects": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "keep": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "into": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "auto",
                "snapshot",
                "original"
              ]
            },
            "backup": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "force": {
              "type": "boolean"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "action"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "blender_op",
        "description": "[v3.1] 34 family / 228 op 的 catalog 算子入口：action=plan op=<op> args={...}（op=catalog 列目录）、loop（参数搜索）、opt、preset。算子实现是随包 Python，不在本适配层重写。会话契约：只读 op（98 个）与 action=help 不需要会话；写算子（含 args.dry_run=true）、loop(target=gui)、opt、preset 都需要 ready 的 GUI 会话；loop target=session 走持久无头 worker。",
        "risk": "high",
        "schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "action": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "plan",
                "loop",
                "opt",
                "preset",
                "help"
              ]
            },
            "op": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "args": {
              "type": "string",
              "description": "算子参数 JSON 对象；dry_run=true 只让算子跳过落盘/写入，仍需 ready 的 GUI 会话"
            },
            "path": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "target": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "gui",
                "session"
              ]
            },
            "limit": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "note": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "kind": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "tags": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "attach_images": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "session": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "spec": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "history": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "board": {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "groups": {
